; JSON event pages expose only schemas enumerated by the current OpenAPI
; EventEnvelopeV1 union. Extensible cursor sync uses this CBOR page so an
; unknown event's exact canonical envelope bytes can be retained and passed to
; OpaqueCanonicalEvent admission without decode/re-encode loss.
; The complete encoded event-page-v1, including this outer framing, MUST be at
; most 1048576 bytes. Writers paginate on accumulated encoded bytes before the
; structural 1000-event limit; an envelope's contextual maximum is therefore
; smaller than its standalone maximum below.
canonical-event-envelope-bytes = bstr .size (1..1048576)
event-cursor = tstr .size (1..512)

event-page-v1 = {
  1: [*1000 canonical-event-envelope-bytes],
  2: event-cursor
}
